{"steam_appid":1991300,"steam_name":"Closer the Distance","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1991300/734425/d30f340967b4d69424ea8c3977aa6404cac08425/1751064956/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722629969","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257042732/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722629969","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/ss_2d2e57d2b7ef77b7f208bc1db5d5ba1522c35879.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734425503","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/ss_1d2af0aa8366267db22721d7e5b2ac005f49145a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734425503","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/ss_a7e20898e2fcaa92a956774a3783bdd5eb7622f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734425503","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/ss_c819bcd1ed9b297c85217754378bfa02d3f83787.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734425503","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/ss_5a01d9ad0f06ed4e1fb6468650c6846722b193a5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734425503"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/0713bbcb986d4038aa1c98b7926e6068.poster.avif?t=1734425503\" width=606 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/0713bbcb986d4038aa1c98b7926e6068.webm?t=1734425503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/0713bbcb986d4038aa1c98b7926e6068.mp4?t=1734425503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Closer the Distance is a deeply moving, slice-of-life sim that tells a story about the connections between family and friends in the face of tragedy. Following a fatal car accident, players take on the role of Angela, a young girl from the town of Yesterby, who finds herself watching over her loved ones as they navigate the grieving process. Using her ethereal ability to influence the townspeople she once knew, Angela’s choices will ultimately determine the fate of Yesterby.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/dabffafec59c6beb539d2abfe12551d5.poster.avif?t=1734425503\" width=606 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/dabffafec59c6beb539d2abfe12551d5.webm?t=1734425503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/dabffafec59c6beb539d2abfe12551d5.mp4?t=1734425503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Closer the Distance combines several key gameplay features for an immersive playthrough. The game's compelling narrative is emotionally charged and highlights themes of empathy, community, friendship, grief, and closure. Choices-matter gameplay allows players to make decisions that affect the outcome of the story, making each playthrough unique. Closer the Distance offers something for everyone, and its emotional depth and engaging gameplay will leave players wanting more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/e70c830e065e5942676fa452930bc17a.poster.avif?t=1734425503\" width=606 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/e70c830e065e5942676fa452930bc17a.webm?t=1734425503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991300/extras/e70c830e065e5942676fa452930bc17a.mp4?t=1734425503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>CW: Closer the Distance deals with themes of death, illness and grief</i>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon r9 200<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 2700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Osmotic Studios"],"publishers":["Skybound Games"],"release_date":"1 Aug, 2024","metacritic_score":85}